  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Avanza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Avanza will build the capacity of civil society to more effectively combat child labor and other labor abuses in Colombia&apos;s coffee sector. By raising awareness and connecting survivors of labor exploitation to services in two of the largest coffee-producing areas of Colombia, the project helps promote supply chains free of exploitative labor and a fair playing field for workers in the U.S. and around the world.</narrative>
  </description>
